INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "I find myself at the base of a rocky mountain with sparse vegetation. The environment is snowy with strong winds, and the temperature is extremely low at -5 degrees. Food and water are scarce, with only a few shrubs bearing berries and frozen streams that are hard to access. Shelter is limited to minimal cover from rock formations, and there are few signs of life except for some scavengers. The danger level is high due to extreme cold, risk of frostbite, and potential avalanches. My overall health is decent, with a sleep score of 10, but I am moderately hungry and thirsty, with an energy level of 5. My body temperature is normal, but I have a slight injury and illness, with exposure at level 3. Given this situation, my immediate action would be to find the most effective shelter from the rock formations to reduce exposure to the cold and wind. I would aim to conserve my energy by staying still and minimizing movement while attempting to increase my body temperature by huddling against the rocks and using any available materials to insulate myself. Simultaneously, I would assess the environment for any signs of food or water that may be accessible without expending too much energy. It is critical to maintain my body temperature and energy levels to avoid increasing my exposure to the cold and worsening my health condition."
}

