INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Upon assessing the environment, I realize that the conditions are extremely harsh. The blizzard and cold temperatures pose a serious threat to my health, especially considering the high danger level and risk of frostbite. My current state of health is compromised with low energy and signs of hunger and thirst. Since I have no prior knowledge or skills to rely on, I must use the limited resources available to me. Immediate priorities should be finding a way to maintain body heat and securing a source of water. Melting snow could provide hydration, but this must be managed carefully to avoid further lowering my body temperature. Searching for shelter among the rock formations to shield against the wind is crucial. Though these formations offer minimal protection, they are the best available option for reducing wind exposure. Additionally, I must remain vigilant of scavengers, as they may become a threat if they are desperate. My next step will be to attempt to melt some snow for water while seeking shelter. I'll use the rocks for shelter and try to huddle or insulate myself to conserve warmth. This should help me maintain my energy as much as possible in preparation for any necessary actions to secure food or safety."
}

