INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the severe environmental conditions and my current health status, survival is the immediate priority. The extreme cold and high winds present a significant risk of frostbite and illness. My energy is low, and hunger is high, which could impair my decision-making and physical capabilities. The lack of visible food sources and limited water availability add to the challenge. Since I have no knowledge or skills recorded in my diary to draw upon, I must focus on basic survival instincts. My current body temperature is slightly below normal, indicating a risk of hypothermia. First, I need to find the most sheltered spot among the sparse rock formations to minimize exposure to the wind and conserve body heat. I must also use any available resources, such as snow, to melt for drinking water, even if it is limited. Although there is a risk of avalanche, finding a small snow-free area could be beneficial for minimizing exposure. I must avoid any confrontations with wildlife, given my low energy and potential aggression from scavengers. The main goal is to maintain body heat and hydration while minimizing energy expenditure until conditions improve or a plan for safer movement can be established. I must learn from this experience to prioritize finding shelter and conserving energy in harsh environments in the future."
}

