INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the severe blizzard conditions, harsh winds, and extremely high danger level, my primary focus is to prioritize survival by seeking immediate shelter to protect against exposure and frostbite. The rock formations, while sparse, offer the best available option to shield against the wind and snow. I will choose a formation that provides the most coverage and position myself to minimize exposure. To combat thirst, I will carefully collect some snow, prioritizing areas that are clean and free from contaminants, and attempt to melt it using body heat, ensuring I manage my body temperature to avoid hypothermia. Considering my low energy and health status, I must conserve energy by minimizing unnecessary movement and focus on strategic actions. With a high injury and illness level, I need to remain vigilant about my health and any potential aggressive wildlife encounters, as my weakened state might attract scavengers. I will monitor my environment closely for any changes in wildlife behavior or environmental shifts, preparing to adapt my strategy as necessary to maintain my health and energy. Despite the overwhelming conditions, my determination to survive drives me to utilize my skills and knowledge effectively."
}

