{
  "action": "The current situation is extremely perilous due to the severe blizzard, extreme cold, and the threat from aggressive wildlife. Given the critical state of my health, with thirst and hunger levels very high, and my body temperature dangerously low, immediate actions are necessary to sustain survival. First, I will focus on conserving energy by limiting movements and staying sheltered as much as possible. I will try to find a more secure position within the rock formations that provide some windbreak to prevent further exposure. Utilizing the skill of melting snow for hydration is crucial; I must try to collect clean snow and use any body heat available to melt it, despite the difficulty posed by the dropping temperatures. I must remain vigilant of the scavengers and avoid any direct encounters by staying hidden and minimizing noise. Monitoring the environment for any changes in weather or wildlife behavior is essential to quickly adapt my strategy. The priority is to maintain body heat, minimize exposure, and secure hydration until conditions improve or more resources become available."
}

