INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the extremely harsh conditions and my current state, it's crucial to prioritize immediate survival strategies. First, I must seek shelter among the sparse rock formations to minimize exposure to the severe cold and blizzard conditions. This will help reduce my exposure level and slightly conserve energy. Next, despite the minimal shelter offered by the rocks, I should try to use any available materials to increase insulation, such as any loose vegetation or debris. Concurrently, I need to attempt melting small amounts of snow using my body heat to maintain hydration, even though it's challenging. It's essential to be cautious of aggressive wildlife, so staying alert and minimizing movement that may attract scavengers is vital. Lastly, I must continue to monitor environmental changes and wildlife behavior, adapt my strategies as necessary, and remain determined to conserve energy while seeking any potential improvements in shelter or resources."
}

