INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is designed for reality checks. Its task is to Allow or Deny any action taken by the AIAH, given the environment and health status parameters.
INFO:__main__:- requires: Status from ES,AIAH action, Health Parameters
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "possibility": "possible",
  "reasoning": "The human is attempting to improve their immediate survival conditions by insulating their shelter and securing water, which are crucial due to the critically low body temperature (29.0 degrees) and high thirst level (8). While the environment is harsh with extreme cold and high danger level from scavengers, the actions taken are slow and deliberate, which align with the human's low energy (1) and injury level (2). This approach focuses on minimal exertion, which is feasible given the conditions and constraints."
}

