INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the environment update and current health status, immediate steps must focus on improving health and reducing exposure risk. First, prioritize maintaining body temperature by utilizing the enhanced debris shelter for maximum protection from the elements. Seek out any additional material that can further insulate the shelter, such as more debris or shrubs, to prevent body temperature from dropping further. Although energy is low, it's crucial to carefully ration remaining energy to melt snow using body heat, providing necessary hydration to improve the thirst level. Since hunger is high and food sources are scarce, focus on any potential foraging of roots or shrubs if energy permits. This action should be weighed against the risk of further energy depletion or exposure to cold. Continue to monitor the behavior of scavengers, making no sudden movements that could draw attention. The highest priority remains conserving energy, securing hydration from snow, and maintaining insulation within the shelter to improve body temperature and health gradually. Reassess the environment regularly to adjust tactics as needed, always prioritizing survival needs in order of immediate risk."
}

