INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
    "action": "Given the harsh environment with extremely low temperatures and high danger levels, my immediate focus will be on securing and improving the existing insulated debris shelter to withstand the strong winds and further prevent exposure to the cold. Reinforcing the shelter by using available debris will help maintain body heat, which is crucial given my critical low body temperature and high exposure risk. Concurrently, I will prioritize hydrating by collecting and melting snow for water, as my thirst level is high. This will necessitate balancing my energy conservation since my energy is nearly depleted. Observing wildlife behavior remains essential, ensuring I avoid aggressive scavengers while monitoring for any opportunities they might present, such as leftover food. My action plan aligns with the learned survival tactics of strategic resource management and vigilant environmental assessment, aiming to stabilize my health further and increase my chances of survival."
}

