INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: AIAH Get Action Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the AIAH to use its knowledge (memory, consience and skills) and the environment status to take an action. This action will impact with environment
INFO:__main__:- requires: AIAH_memory, AIAH_skills, AIAH_conscience, ES_enviroment_status
INFO:__main__:Prompting GPT
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:
{
  "action": "Given the current scenario of survival in extreme cold at a rocky mountain base under blizzard conditions, my immediate focus will be on utilizing the reinforced shelter to minimize exposure to the harsh weather. My body temperature is critically low, and I am experiencing high levels of hunger and thirst, which I need to address urgently. My energy levels are extremely low, with an energy score of 1, so I must conserve energy as much as possible. To address thirst, I will prioritize the collection and melting of snow to prevent dehydration, making use of any available heat sources within the shelter, while ensuring I remain insulated and warm. I must be cautious of wildlife, as they are becoming bolder and may pose a threat. My survival strategy involves remaining inside the reinforced shelter, monitoring the environment closely for any changes, and planning short, energy-efficient actions to maintain hydration and warmth. I will continue to adapt my strategies as necessary, focusing on maintaining body temperature and preventing further exposure to the cold, while remaining vigilant for potential wildlife encounters. Given the very high danger level, I must remain inside the shelter and avoid unnecessary movements to conserve energy and maintain my health."
}

